@anon.42b86dac05eb578258e9e0f4074366cb.166 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [635 x i8] }> <{ [635 x i8] c"Constraints to apply when solving build dependencies.\0A\0ABuild constraints are used to restrict the versions of build dependencies that are selected\0Awhen building a package during resolution or installation.\0A\0AIncluding a package as a constraint will _not_ trigger installation of the package during\0Aa build; instead, the package must be requested elsewhere in the project's build dependency\0Agraph.\0A\0A!!! note\0A    In `uv lock`, `uv sync`, and `uv run`, uv will only read `build-constraint-dependencies` from\0A    the `pyproject.toml` at the workspace root, and will ignore any declarations in other\0A    workspace members or `uv.toml` files." }>, align 1
